      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stepper\"><button aria-label=\"减少数量\">−</button><output>8</output><button aria-label=\"增加数量\">+</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stepper{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--text-primary);font:400 var(--type-body)/1.6 var(--font-app)}.ds-stepper button{width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg-alt);color:var(--accent-primary);font:inherit}.ds-stepper output{min-width:22px;text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-stepper button:hover{background:var(--surface-selected)}.ds-stepper button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent-primary);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A warm illustrated learning companion",
    "overview": "Mine English is a readable, compact learning workspace in warm white and forest green, accompanied by a cream-white cat and a golden, round hamster. The approved 2026-11-10 redesign changes the visual construction across the website: gently hand-drawn outlines, quiet paper surfaces, controlled rounded forms and a small shared family of character illustrations. It does not replace the palette, the Nunito / Noto Sans TC typography, the confirmed size hierarchy or the learning functions.\n\nThe current implementation is defined by the palette and type variables in `src/index.css`, the shared skin in `src/handDrawn.css`, and `src/components/LearningArt.tsx`. These current rules supersede the earlier visual descriptions of rigid rectangular navigation, the old site-icon logo and unrelated page-specific card treatments. Functional decisions and their history remain in `PRODUCT.md`.",
